  "description": "*“Nini’s going to make lots of money and take care of everyone!”*\n\nCuteness, love, and business—she’s got it all \n\nThe heartwarming coming-of-age story of a 4-year-old little entrepreneur!\n\nWith Mom, Dad, and my best friend, the wolf, I’ve come back to find happiness, but this new chapter of my 4-year-old life is on hard mode. Because Nini isn’t a cat anymore. Climbing trees, playing hide-and-seek, they say I can’t do any of it. I need to get strong fast so I can protect everyone. But they say if I hunt for money, I’ll get much stronger. Even if it’s tough, what can I do? I’ve got to earn it, right?!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
